{"entryType": "UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)", "primaryAccession": "O43924", "secondaryAccessions": ["O43250"], "uniProtkbId": "PDE6D_HUMAN", "entryAudit": {"firstPublicDate": "1999-07-15", "lastAnnotationUpdateDate": "2026-11-04", "lastSequenceUpdateDate": "1998-06-01", "entryVersion": 206, "sequenceVersion": 1}, "annotationScore": 5.0, "organism": {"scientificName": "Homo sapiens", "commonName": "Human", "taxonId": 9606, "lineage": ["Eukaryota", "Metazoa", "Chordata", "Craniata", "Vertebrata", "Euteleostomi", "Mammalia", "Eutheria", "Euarchontoglires", "Primates", "Haplorrhini", "Catarrhini", "Hominidae", "Homo"]}, "proteinExistence": "1: Evidence at protein level", "proteinDescription": {"recommendedName": {"fullName": {"value": "Retinal rod rhodopsin-sensitive cGMP 3',5'-cyclic phosphodiesterase subunit delta"}, "shortNames": [{"value": "GMP-PDE delta"}]}, "alternativeNames": [{"fullName": {"value": "Protein p17"}}]}, "genes": [{"geneName": {"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000312", "source": "HGNC", "id": "HGNC:8788"}], "value": "PDE6D"}, "synonyms": [{"value": "PDED"}]}], "comments": [{"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O55057"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "22002721"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "23559067"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "23698361"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "24166846"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "9712853"}], "value": "Prenyl-binding protein that mediates the intracellular trafficking of farnesylated and geranylgeranylated proteins (PubMed:24166846). Acts as a solubilizing factor by extracting prenylated proteins from cellular membranes, shielding their prenyl moieties and promoting their transport between membrane compartments (PubMed:22002721, PubMed:9712853). Cargo release is stimulated by ARL2-GTP and ARL3-GTP (PubMed:22002721, PubMed:23559067). In photoreceptor cells, is required for the proper outer segment targeting of prenylated proteins including GRK1, cone phosphodiesterase PDE6C and RAB28, thereby contributing to photoreceptor function and maintenance (By similarity). Also contributes to the outer segment localization of rod phosphodiesterase catalytic subunits PDE6A and PDE6B, although their targeting is only partially dependent on PDE6D (By similarity). Regulates the subcellular localization of prenylated Ras-family GTPases (PubMed:22002721, PubMed:23698361). Required for the ciliary targeting of the farnesylated phosphoinositide phosphatase INPP5E (PubMed:24166846). Also required for the ciliary targeting of prenylated RPGR (By similarity). Stabilizes the GTP-bound forms of ARL3 and ARL2 by decreasing the dissociation rate of bound GTP and increases their affinity for GTP (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O55057"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "Q95142"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "10518933"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "11980706"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "22002721"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "23559067"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "23698361"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "24166846"}, {"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "source": "PubMed", "id": "9990021"}], "value": "Interacts with ARL3 (GTP-bound form) and ARL2 (GTP-bound form); the interaction promotes release of prenylated cargo proteins from PDE6D (PubMed:10518933, PubMed:22002721, PubMed:24166846). Interacts with the prenylated form of PDE6A and PDE6B catalytic subunits; has no effect on PDE6 enzyme activity but promotes extraction of prenylated PDE6 catalytic subunits from membranes (By similarity). Interacts with prenylated GRK1 and GRK7 (By similarity). Interacts with prenylated Ras family, including HRAS, KRAS, NRAS, RHEB, RAP2A and RAP2C (PubMed:11980706, PubMed:22002721, PubMed:23698361). Interacts with RAB13 (prenylated form); dissociates RAB13 from membranes (PubMed:9712853). Interacts with INPP5E (prenylated form) (PubMed:24166846). Interacts with RAB28 (prenylated form); promotes RAB28 delivery to the photoreceptor outer segments (By similarity). Interacts with RPGR (prenylated form) (PubMed:23559067, PubMed:24166846, PubMed:9990021)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43924", "intActId": "EBI-712685"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q9NXU5", "geneName": "ARL15", "intActId": "EBI-711759"}, "numberOfExperiments": 4, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43924", "intActId": "EBI-712685"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q0P5N6", "geneName": "ARL16", "intActId": "EBI-10186132"}, "numberOfExperiments": 13, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43924", "intActId": "EBI-712685"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P36404", "geneName": "ARL2", "intActId": "EBI-752365"}, "numberOfExperiments": 19, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43924", "intActId": "EBI-712685"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P36405", "geneName": "ARL3", "intActId": "EBI-712710"}, "numberOfExperiments": 11, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43924", "intActId": "EBI-712685"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q5XKR4", "geneName": "OTP", "intActId": "EBI-12865884"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43924", "intActId": "EBI-712685"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P51153", "geneName": "RAB13", "intActId": "EBI-1780121"}, "numberOfExperiments": 2, "organismDiffer": f